sulle selle,

65
00:04:52.980 --> 00:04:56.230
et viimasel ajal ma seda enam väga
väga ei ütle.

66
00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.130
Kas ma panen sulle kokku?

67
00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:12.480
Panen kõike.

68
00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:15.700
No vot natukene aega, see on mõnus.

69
00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:18.929
Peaaegu on aega natukene.

70
00:05:19.029 --> 00:05:21.404
Ei pea jooksma.

71
00:05:24.839 --> 00:05:27.650
Sügiskampaania.

72
00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.320
Kuuendast septembrist.

73
00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.960
On sul mahti ka tulla?

74
00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:34.760
Meile appi.

75
00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:36.280
Kust?

76
00:05:36.380 --> 00:05:38.920
Kellega arutasime,
et paneme kaks programmi nagu

77
00:05:39.020 --> 00:05:42.350
